      "hizbQuarter": 197,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4360,
      "text": "and [golden] ornaments. But all of these are mere enjoyments of the life of this world, and the Hereafter with your Lord is [only] for those who fear Allah.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 35,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 492,
      "ruku": 426,
      "hizbQuarter": 197,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4361,
      "text": "Whoever turns away from the Reminder of the Most Compassionate [i.e., the Qur’an], We assign to him a devil to be his close associate,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 36,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 492,
      "ruku": 427,
      "hizbQuarter": 197,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4362,
      "text": "who will surely avert them from the [right] way, while they think that they are rightly guided.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 492,
      "ruku": 427,
      "hizbQuarter": 197,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4363,
      "text": "Then when he comes to Us, he will say [to his devil associate], “I wish you were as distant from me as the East and West. What a terrible associate [you were]!”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 38,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 492,
      "ruku": 427,
      "hizbQuarter": 197,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4364,
      "text": "[They will be told], “As you have done wrong, it will not benefit you Today that you are sharing the punishment[14].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 39,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 492,
      "ruku": 427,
      "hizbQuarter": 197,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4365,
      "text": "Can you make the deaf hear, or guide the blind or the one who is clearly misguided?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 40,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 492,
      "ruku": 427,
      "hizbQuarter": 197,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4366,
      "text": "Either We take you away [in death], We will surely exact retribution upon them,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 41,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 492,
      "ruku": 427,
      "hizbQuarter": 197,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4367,
      "text": "or We will show you what We warned them of, for We have full power over them.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 42,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 492,
      "ruku": 427,
      "hizbQuarter": 197,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4368,
      "text": "So hold fast to what is revealed to you. You are indeed on a straight path.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 43,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 492,
      "ruku": 427,
      "hizbQuarter": 197,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4369,
      "text": "This [Qur’an] is surely a glory[15] for you and your people, and you will [all] be questioned.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 44,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 492,
      "ruku": 427,
      "hizbQuarter": 197,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4370,
      "text": "Ask those of Our messengers whom We sent before you: Did We appoint gods to be worshiped besides the Most Compassionate?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 45,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 492,
      "ruku": 427,
      "hizbQuarter": 197,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4371,
      "text": "Indeed, We sent Moses with Our signs to Pharaoh and his courtiers, so he said: “I am a messenger of the Lord of the worlds.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 46,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 492,
      "ruku": 428,
      "hizbQuarter": 197,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4372,
      "text": "But as soon as he came to them with Our signs, they laughed at them.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
